<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec rapeseed imports down 25.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec rapeseed imports down 25.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's rapeseed imports in December totalled 132,857 tonnes, down 25.2 percent from the same month a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry statistics released on Monday.</p>
<p>Total imports in calendar 1996 were 1.8 million tonnes, versus 1.87 million tonnes a year earlier.</p>
<p>The breakdown was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			Dec 96	 Nov 96	Dec 95</p>
<p> Total rapeseed   132,857	190,791     177,711</p>
<p>Major supplier of rapeseed (in tonnes):</p>
<p> Canada	     131,593	182,341     171,309</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7391</p>
</text>
